# Runtime data and local service state
**/videos/
**/recordings/
**/Configuration/access/*.json
**/Configuration/connector-binding.json
**/Configuration/camera-secrets.json
**/Configuration/runtime/
**/*.tmp

# Keep static seed/config templates trackable when explicitly needed.
!CentralServer/CentralServer/Configuration/access/.gitkeep
!**/Configuration/*.example.json

# ML model artifacts are large and must not be committed.
Neuro/Neuro/DNNModels/
**/*.onnx
**/*.pt
**/*.pth
**/*.engine
**/*.weights

